    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Coronary heart disease is a common problem that emerged as one of the leading killers of the 20th century. Scientists and physicians have fought hard to battle this menace which has engulfed health delivery systems the world over. More studies have been conducted in this field of medicine than any other, and sufficient evidence has emerged to broaden the chances of finding a cure to this emergent problem.",
